AFAICT, these terminal emulators are VTE based:

   Guake
   LXTerminal
   ROXTerm
   Terminator
   gnome-terminal
   lilyterm
   sakura
   tilda
   xfce4-terminal

These are not:

   Eterm
   Konsole
   Terminology
   Yakuake
   aterm
   mrxvt
   pterm
   putty
   rxvt
   urxvt

